#. y1:english="Huh,{PA:10} you're pretty built.{MS:0}{PA:20}||How about a challenge?\nFor your information,\nI used to be a pitcher for a professional||baseball team.\nI got into a little trouble and well...||I got the pink slip.{PA:20} Hahaha.\n{CU:ffc8c8}I'll pitch 20 magic balls to you.\nIf you can hit 10 home runs,||I'll give you 50,000 yen.{MR:00}\nBut,{PA:10} if you can't pull it off,||you have to pay me 10,000 yen.{PA:20} Sounds good?\nOkay,{PA:10} I'll accept your challenge.\nOkay,{PA:10}||hit 10 or more home runs.\nIf you succeed,{PA:10} you'll get 50,000 yen.{PA:20}||If you fail,{PA:10} I'll get 10,000 yen from you.\nYou can quit now if you're scared.\nI'll quit.\nI see.{PA:20} If you want to challenge me,||you know where you can find me.\nI said I'll accept your challenge.\nOkay,{PA:10} let's begin!\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0085.BIN:36_0_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0085.BIN::line:36_0_0"
msgid "Eh, estás muy fuerte.{MS:0}||¿Qué te parece un desafío?"
msgstr ""

