#. y1:english="Are you some kind of monster...\nTell me now!{PA:20}||Who ordered the hit!\nYou expect me to talk?\nYou have no choice unless you wanna die.\nUghhh... {PA:10}Okay...{PA:10}\nI don't have the details anyways.\nI don't care who the client is||{MS:0}as long as I get paid...\nI'm not interested in your business.\nIt was a captain from the Tojo Clan.\nHe didn't state his name,{PA:20}\nbut... he seemed to be a||very important person in the family.\nDoesn't that ring a bell for you?\n......\n...Tell me one thing.{PA:20}||{MS:0}Where did you get my cell phone?\nI found it on the body of a guy||who got killed by some robbers.\nI guess he was down on his luck..\n...So am I.{PA:20}\nIf you blow it once in this world,||you're finished.\nThe client will rub you out||in no time.\n......\nYou should take this.\nYou received a bulletproof vest.\n\nI hope you can forgive me with this.{PA:20}||{MS:0}Besides...\nYeah?\nIf you got killed by someone else,||I'd feel like shit.\nHeh.{PA:20}||What are you gonna do?\nI'll try to stay alive as long as I can.{PA:20}||I don't think I'll make it though...\nI don't have any information\nSo I'm gonna go.\nYou gave the cell phone back to him.\nYou gained 500 exp.\n"
