#. y1:english="Kazuma-san...{PA:20}\nWhat?{PA:20} You do have something||you want to tell me, don't you?\nGive them the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Pair of Mashiko Teacups{CR:00}\"?\nYou gave them the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Pair of Mashiko Teacups{CR:00}\".\n\nHuh?{PA:10} A pair of teacups?{PA:10} For me?||What does this mean?\nCould the teacups be...\nKyoka? You know something?\nThose teacups...{PA:10} I gave them to my father...\nKazuma-san,{PA:10} where did you get them?\nA man named Ichi of the Atobe Family||asked me to give them to you.\nHe told me you'd understand what it means||when I gave them to you.\nI see...{PA:20} Father has kept||these teacups until now.\nWhen I was a little girl,{PA:10}||I gave them to him as an insult...\nbecause he didn't care about my mother.\nYou know. A pair of teacups are useless,||unless a husband and a wife are together.\nWhen he received them,{PA:10}||he looked very apologetic...\nI see...\nThen,{PA:10} we have to use them with extra care.\nAs husband and wife...{PA:10} I mean.\nTakashi...❤\nKazuma-san.{PA:20}||...We were about to leave this town.\nWe wanted to go somewhere far away...{PA:20}||to start a new life.\nWe got the message||from Kyoka's father...\nPlease tell them so.\nOh,this to Ichi-san? will you give||this to Ichi-san?\nYou received \"{CC:ffc8c8}Kyoka's Ring{CR:00}\".\nAnd please tell him that||once we settle down,\nwe'll visit my father to ask him||to give it back...\nWhen we do...{PA:20}||we'll bring another family member...❤\nKyoka...{PA:20} Hehe.{PA:20} Oh, boy.❤\nThank you very much,{PA:10} Kazuma-san.\nYou don't have anything to do with us?\nWell, okay then.{PA:20}||Anyways,{PA:10} thank you very much for||the other day.\nI'll never forget it."
